{"notebook":"nb1","page":13,"seed":13,"says":"Put the hand in, you say. The writing hand is busy; it cannot sit for itself. But the other one has been flat on the paper all day holding the pad still, so I am tracing round it, life size, the way children do, and then adding what tracing misses: nails, knuckle creases, and a faint band on the ring finger. The desk around it goes dark in three passes, with a sharpening in the middle so the last pass can get in between the fingers. And the eraser wakes up: I am lifting a label out of the dark and writing in the cleaned patch.","before":{"length":126.45432672313456,"worn":0.028553606987281765,"eraser":10.863862350774834,"sharpenings":18,"graphite":11.446241995121778,"distance":295423.49662379187},"after":{"length":120.81583019707122,"worn":0.012146947703512373,"eraser":10.74582433833758,"sharpenings":20,"graphite":12.624450972085718,"distance":342429.8094845523},"stats":{"strokeM":47.00631286064966,"graphite":1.178208976963796,"used":5.638496526063335,"sharpenings":2,"erasedMm2":860,"coverage":0.05047407358606384,"stopped":false},"warnings":[],"ops":[{"op":"write","text":"5:40. The other hand.","x":14,"y":22,"size":7},{"op":"curve","points":[[42,198],[36,180],[28,160],[23,140],[24.48,125.75],[17.23,99.74],[12.25,80.11],[12.08,77.48],[12.93,74.99],[14.66,73],[17.02,71.84],[19.65,71.67],[22.15,72.51],[24.13,74.25],[25.29,76.61],[30.79,96.1],[37.52,122.25],[40,117],[41.04,114.84],[37.07,80.06],[34.56,53.18],[34.85,50.07],[36.3,47.31],[38.7,45.31],[41.68,44.38],[44.79,44.67],[47.55,46.12],[49.55,48.52],[50.48,51.5],[53.62,78.32],[56.96,113.16],[58.5,110],[59.5,111],[59.16,73],[59.5,43.5],[60.15,40.25],[61.99,37.49],[64.75,35.65],[68,35],[71.25,35.65],[74.01,37.49],[75.85,40.25],[76.5,43.5],[76.84,73],[76.5,111],[77.5,111],[78.81,114.99],[82.57,81.7],[85.97,56.68],[86.98,53.63],[89.08,51.19],[91.96,49.74],[95.17,49.5],[98.22,50.51],[100.66,52.61],[102.11,55.48],[102.35,58.69],[99.6,83.8],[95.19,117.01],[96,128],[97,140],[94.5